⚡ Alternative: PowerShell (One-Liner!)
If you want to grab the flag without even opening a browser:

(Invoke-WebRequest -Uri "http://YOUR-CHALLENGE-URL:PORT/").Content | Select-String -Pattern "picoCTF\{.*?\}" -AllMatches | ForEach-Object { $_.Matches.Value }

Part	Meaning
Invoke-WebRequest	Download the page ⬇️
.Content	Get the HTML text
Select-String -Pattern "picoCTF\{.*?\}"	Find the flag pattern 🔍
ForEach-Object { $_.Matches.Value }	Print just the flag

🎉 Flag prints in your terminal! 

